"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Mae copï wrth gefn yn cadw eich gosodiadau, gosodiadau safwe, ciwiau a' r rhestr lawrlwythiadau. Ni roddir cyfrineiriau na bisgedi mewn copï wrth gefn.";
